  "caveat": "Classic ESP32 BLE4.2 legacy advertising/connections only; no BLE5 extended,2M,CodedPHY. Input-only GPIO34/35/36/39 lack internal pulls. UART0 remapped to LD2450; GPIO1/3 USB-UART only. MC2-D is not TinyC6 socket-compatible. XIAO requires MC2-D antenna-aware RCP firmware and two bottom-pad recovery leads.",
